  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SME Investment fund in clean tech financing and/or Mpumalanga</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing a side car to a fund manager which will used primarily for first loss - absorbing the first 20% of losses of any deal pertaining to investment into SMEs in clean tech and or in Mpumalanga. Thereafter the other investors would bear the loss.  Some funding might be used for blending. A portion of the funding will go to resourcing for deals in the coal mining area/to absorb some of the transaction costs. The project aims increase jobs in coal mining areas and or mitigate against emissions.</narrative>
  </description>
